{"id":74826063565441,"type":"album","name":"Beloved! Paradise! Jazz!?","artist":"McKinley Dixon","year":2023,"weight":15,"info":{"cover":"https://dn721904.ca.archive.org/0/items/mbid-606e4923-5630-4d6e-a3db-bea6fc669225/mbid-606e4923-5630-4d6e-a3db-bea6fc669225-35127891698.jpg","sputnik":3.79,"yt":"Z9VvZpeemO0","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/mckinley-dixon/beloved-paradise-jazz","sputnikmusic":"https://www.sputnikmusic.com/album/460207/McKinley-Dixon-Beloved%21-Paradise%21-Jazz%21/"},"desc":"Beloved! Paradise! Jazz!? is the fourth studio album from American musician McKinley Dixon. Released on June 2, 2023, it is a jazz rap and conscious hip-hop album. On November 30, 2022, the album's first single, \"Sun, I Rise\", featuring Angélica Garcia was released. The album's second single, \"Tyler, Forever\", a tribute to a friend who passed away, was released on January 17, 2023. On March 7, the third single, \"Run, Run, Run\" was released. On April 26, the album's fourth single, title track \"Beloved! Paradise! Jazz!?\" was released. The album's fifth single, \"Dedicated to Tar Feather\" featuring Anjimile was released ."},"artist_ref":{"id":222041394020134,"name":"McKinley Dixon","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":136937573393074,"type":"genre","name":"hip hop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1554,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":265524373450282,"type":"genre","name":"jazz","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1461,"yt":null,"src":"musthear"},{"id":26869950655266,"type":"genre","name":"Conscious Hip Hop","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":252,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":145450397810410,"type":"genre","name":"Jazz Rap","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":238,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":96948353641453,"name":"Bandcamp: The Best Albums of 2023","src":"charts","grp":"musicbrainz","list_year":null,"rank":17,"year":2023,"note":null,"total":41,"scaruffi":null},{"id":218418549494922,"name":"RYM Top — Hip Hop — Jazz Ra